{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1418,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb3699f04d71d506508e652f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "伸展运动也要踏踏实实地，仔细地。\n这种积累也是我的武器。",
      "source_fingerprint": "146ec86d0b1abf204babf30142b53e5c2d815a951b6517f6dbb6f99314381cd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7275ce7ab37ac856552d0ddb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用自己的脚，踏着大地。\n用自己的脚奔跑。\n仅仅这样我的内心就激动不已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb88dbc80034bb3ad77f27aac3503391e4fe7e573f2e99ca383d463dec2d901d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b55122fb98ef5840e1514d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "珍惜现在的这个瞬间。\n每秒都集中精神，\n让今天成为最棒的一天吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56e3cebb8a087f64b88ea113acfdd6793192cf5e24cae20304ad795e12ccb793",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63616f0c7011349f7dc2454f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢您每天为我制定考虑\n到负担的训练目标。\n我会以结果来回答您的。一定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32159e2b77e4f7ec02065f0119dce0ba9cd4a824e69b4c2323f2c4a5d56e9efb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:459d5d0a9be3b619b6dd8a93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "渐渐看到了自己身上的『光辉』。\n这光辉，一定会照亮我们的现在…",
      "source_fingerprint": "004c4e69f8ce1f2ebe1c64f0c330496ad71b3453cb2ba6df7d7c444ae7aeb147",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21b43f7800be20b0e5f9bea5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "两人一起走过的道路，\n现在仍是我所骄傲的事。\n在这一个个瞬间的重叠前方，一定…",
      "source_fingerprint": "22c9d92ff899cfbbf140d475b59d39402fdfc73df6a13190013f8d97d7dd3c96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bd234e31aa72c9fed1c246b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是一个适合高效训练\n的环境。这个夏天，让我们\n比太阳更闪耀吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0531e007e7b42fa28586e415616e0261cbbe691f43a6ca2a342af6c21d8b80cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d281c52b023fe6fcec26dc58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能在舞台上抬头挺胸──\r\n还请你教导我了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2756eb45e92d61d0a69664f0d004699d1a05b89a0d9803b003a2950a4dfb11d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0426bc55af42610b18eaa85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我就是我。\r\n不被周遭影响心志，\r\n只用自己的方式奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5443a05845cd042f9c6c059cb8cb923215ad2791ae7183082e8d938c55e09c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80b0570a034b49bde6fd5f6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不论遇到多大的艰难，\r\n我都不会停下……也无法停下。\r\n因为我无法欺骗自己的梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e10cf83014ac19b1911d013771cbc9f8201125ca2d29e21272da330831c8597",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ea3f942e6f523dcc8ebebb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也脚踏实地地\r\n踩着明确的步伐前进吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f4192901de344a28fdbd50aaadab5e217ebf7243a2d30fffb9d3fe026ae5261",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac56cc7c8a1eed994967a4ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的目标是梦想的舞台。\r\n首先，就让我们搭档间的\r\n呼吸同步吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb4c21b0f92c8c16e1a4e5438e6843dbbc03de6158dd5869ffaf9746ed91a7d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:072888b5aa27a9b00dc611ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的身体已经慢慢习惯训练员的\r\n步调，不论是怎样的训练项目\r\n我都会努力配合。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fab5115a755bfa7273f2a8329840ddc7a4121c3cadc7cdb4bb0b9f67f8d1d04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dc253ac844462e03085f13c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要这双脚仍未破碎，\r\n就让我们继续在赛场上起舞吧。\r\n还请你陪伴着我到最后啰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c9fab002d626e47d3eb4c61f5fe287eee0461c9215357f08a3aac15c0336e8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce8969da858b1e4573e24e23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最重要的这个光辉，献给你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d69b00c1674b5abfdd3e67ed8d6bf5e1749257296aab3e62c000f6a47d2a5dc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ef29eda20d9dbbc9b25d546",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "玻璃般的双脚，给我带来了幸福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c53bf3a92ba2c5839904d845aaa3d4bd84c424cb04a0fc6e359fcc8aa0149f75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ad818b66b200b91c25673a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们携手共进──\r\n迈向下一座舞台吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2033673498477694ce606426e779801374566ec9d841680d08263f6b4c61b06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec6a2fdeff2aa22b97edc14e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你领导得相当出色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e4a9ef4a8c4a1acd72f3382f8fcb90594ca2b69cea969a76275697394446c8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46209e3d215e3a0dda659861",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不能退缩，还要继续，向前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab36dcc3f7add2601d51c14db3fa7bf7221a9c32ddad18d3492f9f0f92a1ff60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:900f549f1209f55c440ff6fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让这一瞬间的光辉…更加强烈…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "511f200336dd54d8f520c1c2526eee3dc707e7880510290dea41120a77e9d860",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c98eeba46efd1c41895a3c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，我是目白阿尔丹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d09dd1f70478f1ab8b8e85fc4cbc95816aa4c778e3a7e9fdb4e7423a3e9df09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e71af9f4f212b5bdef888fcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在这个『现在』。\n为了这一瞬间的光辉――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "267027e57d0cecf96c814bec590ee3ea7e2079bccb7011fbcf09bf5bdfeab08d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8adc79d958c31877123adeaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能帮上忙吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e3b0012267cbafebe3df807df7c29e64c9118cf3dedb1ca23251d897813a585",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f4b32f00538e5bacb5ca06a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我竟然有这样的力量…",
      "source_fingerprint": "197d4289ad1080fa8900bae64bc28c445f785e300136940337ff16d20d3f3d03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d2338204b3fdb7a5dadcde9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有股内心雀跃的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39c4797f861f3f3a823168c0e77e71f9d1294dc30b4017a09d733fdcd62af4c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fe05da92443d42fa134b9c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉现在的我，\r\n可以站上任何舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e954e0ded59ac6da0518084ac0044b60b645f32a0e145890ce712429bbd4111d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ab5f0481898f073da326ce8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "梦幻华尔兹或是热情的探戈──\r\n一切如您所望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88ee9f5ee7c909d2d78ae49445be3de5482fbca8d7c488bcc808a3dd98827dec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:191176f32a6a95156fd2911e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是目白阿尔丹。\r\n护送一职就包在我身上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff490bce6fae9b412dac371278a93bb58b30d5a53b387c829e9f44b6f223683f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1071",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47e0ab9c3a25a72b3c78edb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赌上一切！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90df567e96e3ab7406cdfa567da35eb6ce611c0cb82cc5a58f902be9eedf2663",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bf95d71bbf9a91e767f54a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟训练员一同努力修行时，\r\n曾窥见了「火水合一」的境地……\r\n我片刻不曾忘记。",
      "source_fingerprint": "302f1a914de6b3950605c8e79c29fd7e1ae2786677846d25494aa72f70870f2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64083e653589c41f0fbde4a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "793275eb5254d9ee0aa95daa33c90a973bec2e4a987e75c094e5b5d339927bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2cbe67a24e66b33240ea05e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戻りました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7cc6951a920e8084573735e4a0908d6d6b34e24b6a55a0aeb4ac698d3b94d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f61e1d9df6fcf67a03e96128",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能遇见良师是我无可取代的宝物。\r\n居然在跑步这条路上也能拥有优秀的\r\n师父，我真是太受眷顾了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1927b308ca3f727400d399b2915dffb0f5e6eac6141a15a24fe410f1d10e9846",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c221252db6b92981799adc60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还不够成熟，不足以压抑自身的\r\n「烈火」……说来惭愧，\r\n往后也请你多加指导鞭策。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d2f69ef1e186333e66e95b205e07f3687d2d7802088472156fca3dd51c71962",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98e4dde359521b12f9dbda14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n一年之计在于元旦……\r\n即使天寒，我仍要努力修行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7855964ee0a6d0b3eceb1e714dfcc736c994cd6bc7e6041fe3f636928120b396",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a87d3d9a6383b2ff5089bbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我带着对师父的「情义」制作了\r\n巧克力！不是人情巧克力，而是\r\n情义巧克力……敬请笑纳！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e4f0b0e8504653e6780def43afe2ae5fee69cd76d65a0d797cdabc128d1953b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:923128cb3f060fa02b783783",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我、我为了今天准备了\r\n美丽的蔷薇与郁金香！！\r\n请多多指教！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd27fdd74a905d5f5d021d51846aec4f72d35ec67d9d9ccb10610e80dfca4714",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f1cdf98eaa3c8006acd89f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每年我都会对着银河许下\r\n同一个愿望。\r\n我一定要变得更强……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63d9dfe337b59d0add09ff7255fc7755bee349f0c08a12d946a605122a4961eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c7054e627d3744a3cf95ade",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说今天怪物们会在街上昂首阔步。\r\n为了守护柔弱的人们，\r\n我也得出门才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9359d9cc3bbd9e244b459a4f111d8f5f9d7036c3e775e423998d2134a8af867c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80e317f97b8fbf450cb8a64b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一晚之间就能走遍全世界……\r\n圣诞老人若是真的存在，\r\n或许是使用缩地的能手喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9da9708bd6c07d31d0ed9c88bdb1acac851a06b9b0f5ccef2256788c421b12b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34f4c918aa64b790e9bbf6e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很久以前我曾许愿想收到「最强」\r\n当圣诞礼物……结果祖父扮成\r\n圣诞老人，为我进行了特训。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d4ca5e8acc0975920892f99640c0c13243aabd8b1afe98ab4c371607f8bd0e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:743a32758a0e568ca2eb3432",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "互相帮助对方提升了实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4ddc7c3a9015693e34594ac3fe12cc77edd6d0aeba356f71366057764a83426",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccff9acab96d81233f273291",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大扫除……论起用抹布擦地的技术，\r\n我可是已经出师了喔。\r\n有需要请尽量吩咐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec78baeb4f5d03c77eb0ad2fdbfbd2b120960e8761ff6282ead8b2714e3f8404",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63937d2dd47b2c007a9e998b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐。\r\n随着年龄增长，你也正在人生道路上\r\n逐渐蜕变成一名高手呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ccd65331d17b36357f7938c5504f6dc5e57199139a266d8ad28f3f210ae519b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6618c7b4c32ef8ca6edce278",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯……我也想看看训练员\r\n幼时的照片呢，\r\n就当作回顾过去吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4520005cdbf224ff757f0733e0fb300097ea8e7589a90edd16b8b02aed73a119",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2322543050c2344e745e63d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老家寄了相簿给我，说是生日纪念。\r\n里面还有我小时候暴躁失控的\r\n照片……真难为情……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e3768fd3eb0b2138368975126377cf13446dde754f996e7a8d2720c57c599e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c72d0609f97ea87dbf488a24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日……一路走来我遇见武术，\r\n遇见比赛，还遇见了你……\r\n藉此机会回顾过往，也是不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e58682f9de22f8e11777b56a98370dc4cf04c565b27366db7bbaa16dbe0208c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a24dda2eb658fa37b0a51d26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎收到了新公告。\r\n嗯……打开一探究竟吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e60a5a691907a68e9dc63b8f2208edf3a93db341269e15d23dbe58c9314c411",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61006f6f1e238400f4087343",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎收到了要给训练员的东西。\r\n难道是秘传的卷轴……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "03a1d83c8a7b1e84360da33721f57b57ef0ebb4d0cdcde3bca489e3b824be6dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:994539e575c7d7d1c0d77fcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "传来了通过考验的通知。\r\n请收下这份证明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ee019f51f93114ac41e6f3801094d70725e132943dcd605b3575564ea0c52fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6dca55fb206e734652f3946",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎即将举办盛大的活动呢。\r\n……该不会是要集合各流派\r\n来场生死决战……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "134508c604fce8f03d1fcb57d6729d5e99d80a7a14b054d47f00b8daea845ff9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21b929add65e0387900d4373",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这股斗气……看来现在某处\r\n正在展开一场炙热的决战呢。\r\n我们也前去加入吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "caf618405d7fb7648407c2e2c7dbb83b58033753741c1591321a0c102439edbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b2fece2fa458397d2ed347d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "力有未逮……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "226ac30b27303de055f932f6a98a6c2c707d8366f813e1e12c3d14b7420c2622",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa21e04bbdbee87e50595842",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴等级提升了。\r\n这是我们日夜钻研的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e5370b0d0412183291ea0609d120c581b6cfd4984d89635ed8a3b0bc02489fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cff35e058ab13315d164efa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "幼少期はわが身の粗暴さゆえ、\r\n服に穴を開けては繕う日々でした。\r\nこの服は大事にしたいものです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b05644612431724cf5cfe303eebb6561362f1529e09ba2c4738c34ba3d87ee5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7369a193bc59d0adb37c8969",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この服はどんな修行にも耐えられ\r\nます。水上を走る試練に、岩を砕く\r\n試練…ともに潜り抜けた戦友です！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af284bc84afe6456ae134bd1bbd28ebea3ebdddf40f3b81e365beda4e7014240",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2daa6b4e9e0a09ef6092413e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "弟とジョギングする時は重しを\r\nつけて走ります。追いつかれる\r\nたび重しを減らすと喜ぶんですよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41fcf5e2b17d57f37ce7c2c30e4cd6634613cda3e94c878c121e3793540c5bff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1027fa08f86090a5c69af6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非常感谢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89543484a8bb0d4eccf8aa729c9eaace993bac645d1655911a89474a71aefb9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d007e924e2b08f54bda33791",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位，做得好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bea9dcd0eb9e7768d999397544fc8745b43ba52331737f53d4970047bea22e22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c64d818e837f0a4bb2833144",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "力有未逮……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "226ac30b27303de055f932f6a98a6c2c707d8366f813e1e12c3d14b7420c2622",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c2354cbac70d75bd06fd901",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非常感谢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89543484a8bb0d4eccf8aa729c9eaace993bac645d1655911a89474a71aefb9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d7137f170e431923c11ec84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前往未曾到达的境地！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e19c89e45332e954179633f6733adf066b034aca237408660385fe55edaf4530",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec74d978107f942e2f28cc0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝各位武运昌隆！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77ea19800a233f7111106f2c71190f164abc494f4ee78d8269294232c7cbed70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba70ece6f350ad1a65508017",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b0b5956ec34a15ac1c5bf3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每一天都是修行。\r\n今天也提起干劲好好努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb6a96f96d52a840d246f1449ee089991e952057829cbfbafebfe95629767209",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:184fec1ff1e578a1d7534e71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学园的历史……借古鉴今\r\n可以学到不少教训呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "319c6b39b6ffa28f9c27e58750f911f5c15964fbfa6a7c8d1f848d53be612de4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1d47a40e924ffcd006f2152",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也要继续挑战与\r\n强者们比赛对决吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b5897ae84f777de9864ae1f43aca6cf3b6f8197aa07091e4b26e10f2d3f0865",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29c7a8eb59eeccfdf42e793c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「没能得胜！」",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eaa33b4abc20d5df232d0cfee20371408c63fdcd180c850007314336f2d174a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "1132"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6d9eb862bbc23e079ff3968",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喝啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "087e620e84bddd10660185fb26dd641301ab5430b398073f62fd71099cb4546e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "1134"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebf425c41acbe1077547fdf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "双人奥义！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "685fe99c0309b2241458d6f605fb1a1b69ff1558af45437154bbf8c5219fe932",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "1143"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:113752d3002d0b253974059b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽力守护！",
      "source_fingerprint": "980e7a14cf004c678db3eaf409ef4789a647a13a568e54f15bca69a7ac3f625b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "1144"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02fe09d509c1cbb30ef17fb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ddaf5b5de13a1b972c9498c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "简直就像灵魂中燃起了火焰……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c85a30e778809a48fa11188f001218dc7b49482c28db6e96f9dad4306b7c957",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8977d4ec796823bfa254395",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请收下今天的登录奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d3f96172a458d7e4088ccb7042d06c8e68bf982a7662a6272c4c64e02a75fc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9df845bda388a94ccd22900",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "清楚看准时机吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "849b6d79045376f2631aadf108de77abbe4a9990e8696b4ec7d40ec41abfcf8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bc2bb23d76824b724e87247",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "613dae1fa0f9adf4924870c929bc20aacafcda48b809c6d3932fbccb808ea3d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58841b0a47580ea184748d1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e25fbfb5adf006063d769535cca5c4bf887ead87e21d1fb7929b3b1028061378",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b909d8bc4dcefe48cb9a4fbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "实在是太精彩了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e42109da41e150fce7149965cecba8743c4c365e93548b3502cfb2f922d110a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31b622548fad33af0e20173c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4ee343917a8c038770956ff3311b839e41d406f29ddc1913f16d6977e136061",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c450ecf4e4b497cd557960f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜负取决于当下运气……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8469f673d6249d634c6d743e2c9938d3c588ca7f01803950c8a2c363da9727ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
